\paragraph{Statement recorded in the supplied source.}
Find analogues of the Griesmer bound, together with Solomon–Stiffler-type constructions attaining them, for coding spaces equipped with metrics other than Hamming distance. \href{https://doi.org/10.4171/owr/2025/41}{[S2]}
